# A width-folded name IS the plain name (§7, the identifier rule) — not a
# reinterpretation, because folding defines what the name is. The consumer
# receives the folded spelling, so that is what the expected file writes.
#
# The keys must be distinct AFTER folding: two spellings that fold together
# into one mapping are the duplicate-key akan, tested under error/.
ｎａｍｅ: 1
ＦＵＬＬ: 2
ｆｕｌｌ＿ｋｅｙ: 3
other: 4
